4070 4698 4045 4659 L 2522 2112 Q 2496 2074 2489 2035 Q 2483 1997 2483 1901 L 2483 109 Q 2483 0 2362 0 L 1978 0 Q 1914 0 1894 25 Q 1875 51 1875 96 L 1875 1875 Q 1875 1939 1862 1971 Q 1850 2003 1824 2048 L 282 4646 Q 256 4691 272 4720 Q 288 4749 352 4749 L 813 4749 Q 870 4749 896 4733 Q 922 4717 947 4672 L 2138 2624 Q 2176 2554 2208 2550 Q 2240 2547 2278 2611 L 3462 4672 Q 3488 4723 3513 4736 Q 3539 4749 3597 4749 L 3994 4749 L 3994 4749 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-38\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-48\" transform=\"translate(56.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-3b\" transform=\"translate(115 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(169.796875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(207.09375 0)\"/></g></g></g><g id=\"patch_3\"><path d=\"M 51.025173 133.056 L 190.806991 133.056 L 190.806991 16.896 L 51.025173 16.896 z\n\" clip-path=\"url(#pbd71d010bc)\" style=\"fill: #0a8f9c\"/></g><g id=\"patch_4\"><path d=\"M 225.752446 133.056 L 365.534264 133.056 L 365.534264 77.741714 L 225.752446 77.741714 z\n\" clip-path=\"url(#pbd71d010bc)\" style=\"fill: #c2410c\"/></g><g id=\"patch_5\"><path d=\"M 35.299719 133.056 L 35.299719 11.088 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #cccccc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"patch_6\"><path d=\"M 35.299719 133.056 L 381.259719 133.056 \" style=\"fill: none; stroke: #cccccc; stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-linejoin: miter; stroke-linecap: square\"/></g><g id=\"text_9\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(114.811707 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" d=\"M 992 102 Q 992 0 877 0 L 429 0 Q 333 0 333 90 L 333 640 Q 333 723 403 723 L 928 723 Q 992 723 992 646 L 992 102 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-88\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(66.796875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\" transform=\"translate(87.703125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_10\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(289.45898 75.773714) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(64.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(85.8125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"pbd71d010bc\"><rect x=\"35.299719\" y=\"11.088\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"121.968\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Payback in years","note":null},"answer":"<p>Volume rises to 1,478 tonnes. Saving: 1,478k × $0.47 − $250k = <b>$445k</b>. Payback: <b>4.0 years</b>, within target.</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> the decision depends on the expansion. Build only if the new hotels are committed, and size the plant for them. This assumes the $1.8M plant can handle the larger volume and the new hotels are open from the start: if the plant ran on today's volume for two years first, payback would be about 5.1 years, so time the build to the openings.</p>"},{"q":"What else would you check before deciding?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>Quality and speed:</b> does the outside laundry cause complaints or stock-outs?</li><li><b>Risk:</b> one plant serving all hotels needs a backup contract</li> <li><b>Contract:</b> could Heatherfield negotiate a lower outside price with its larger volume, which may beat building?</li><li><b>Site and staff:</b> land, permits, hiring</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Don't build the laundry on today's six hotels: it saves about $213k a year, a payback of 8.4 years against a five-year target. If the three new hotels are committed, the saving rises to about $445k and payback falls to 4.0 years, so build when they open (two years at today's volume first would push payback to about 5.1 years), sized for 1,350 rooms. Meanwhile, use the coming volume to negotiate a lower price with the outside laundry. Risk: a single plant is a single point of failure, so keep a backup contract.","great":["Computes volume from rooms and occupancy","Separates variable from fixed costs","Works out the volume needed to hit the target","Ties the answer to the expansion plan"],"id":51,"slug":"heatherfield-hotels"}